mw2coop patch for maps/gulag.gsc (The Gulag, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)
Co-op logic lives in mw2coop/scripts/maps/_mw2coop_gulag.gsc.

1. Landing: player 2 gets off the helicopter with player 1.
@@@ replace
	level.player_view_controller Delete();
	ent Delete();
@@@ with
	level.player_view_controller Delete();
	ent Delete();
	maps\_mw2coop_gulag::partner_leaves_heli();
@@@ end

2. Enemies cannot hit "the player" in the bathroom and rescue scenes: both players
   (maps\_mw2coop::players_attackeraccuracy), the partner is in the same scene.
@@@ subst gulag_bathroom
level.player.attackeraccuracy = 0;
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop::players_attackeraccuracy( 0 );
@@@ end
@@@ subst gulag_rescue
level.player.attackeraccuracy = 0;
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop::players_attackeraccuracy( 0 );
@@@ end

3. The riot shield draws enemies' fire to whoever carries it: each player has his own watcher
   (maps\gulag_code::player_riotshield_threatbias on self, player 1 alone outside co-op).
@@@ subst main
	thread player_riotshield_threatbias();
@@@ to
	foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player thread player_riotshield_threatbias();
@@@ end
